    {
      "q": "How do you play Number Link Flow?",
      "a": "Touch and drag from any numbered circle to connect it with its matching colored number. Fill all empty squares in the grid to win."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can pipes cross each other?",
      "a": "No, pipes cannot overlap or cross each other. Drawing over an existing pipe will disconnect or shorten it."
    },
